    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in the heart of East Cork’s rolling countryside, Caprio is a detached residence of rare charm and character, set on just over one acre of truly mature, private gardens. To say this site is mature is an understatement—with beautiful old trees, a stone wall boundary (part of a period property), and a sweeping driveway, this home offers peace, privacy, and endless potential.\r\n\r\nJust over 1 km from Cloyne Village, and easily accessible to the East Cork coastline, this property is ideal for those seeking country living with conveniences close by.\r\n\r\nAccommodation – c. 190 sq. m (2,045 sq. ft)\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall (3.62m x 1.33m)\r\nTiled flooring, stained-glass windows providing warmth and colour on entry.\r\n\r\nDining Room (3.65m x 6.6m)\r\nSpacious room perfect for family gatherings.\r\n\r\nLiving Room (4.3m x 7.3m)\r\nA statement space with a red-brick fireplace, cast-iron wood-burning stove, and exposed timber beams adding character.\r\nIncludes an alcove (1.79m x 2m) ideal as an office or reading nook.\r\n\r\nDouble doors open into a rear sunroom (2.4m x 5m) with a tiled floor and views over the garden.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Guest Toilet\r\nIncludes WHB and tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room (5.93m x 4.5m)\r\nA traditional country kitchen with fully fitted units, tiled flooring, and exposed beams for added charm.\r\nA separate pantry offers excellent storage and is fully tiled.\r\n\r\nUtility Room (3.62m x 1.87m)\r\nPlumbed and practical, also with tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Accommodation\r\nMain Bedroom (4.53m x 4.83m)\r\nA spacious double room to the rear with built-in units and a private ensuite.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (4.7m x 3.1m)\r\nBright double bedroom to the front with closet storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (4.43m x 2.56m)\r\nDouble room with closet, leading into:\r\n\r\nStudy (3m x 3.5m)\r\nPerfect as a home office, nursery, or dressing room, complete with a closet.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom (2.1m x 2.2m)\r\nFully tiled and well-appointed.\r\n\r\nExternal Features\r\n• Large Detached Garage (5.7m x 6m)\r\n• The garden features mature planting, old specimen trees, and tranquil natural surroundings.\r\n\r\nLocation & Accessibility\r\n• Just over 1 km from Cloyne, offering local shops, a primary school, a historic tower and cathedral, cafés, and pubs.\r\n• Approx. 10 minutes to Midleton for supermarkets, boutiques, train station, and the Jameson Heritage Centre.\r\n• Approx. 30 minutes to Cork City via the R630 and N25.\r\n• Approx. 35 minutes to Cork Airport.\r\n• Enjoy close proximity to East Cork’s beautiful coastline, with Ballycotton, Garryvoe, and Ballinwilling beaches just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nCaprio is more than a house—it’s a lifestyle opportunity. Whether you’re seeking a family home with space to grow or a peaceful escape with potential, this property delivers charm, character, and tranquillity in abundance."
      },
